  "user_impact": "Confusing page changes for keyboard users.",
  "technical_impact": "onfocus handlers trigger navigation.",
  "source": "WCAG 2.2 SC 3.2.1 On Focus; HTML §6.6.7 autofocus",
  "applicability": "Rendered elements with the autofocus attribute.",
  "expectation": "Needs review when autofocus is set on something that is not a text-entry\nfield (a button): moving focus there on load can disorient, but on its own\nit is no change of context, so never a confirmed violation. autofocus on an\ninput, select, textarea or a textbox/searchbox/combobox role is not\nreported.",
